{"verdict":"ready_for_human_review","summary":"The candidate video meets all Statistico Regression film requirements in terms of narration, visual structure, technical delivery, and highlight overlay behavior. Narration and visual sequences align with prescribed standards: the opening, transition, live scenario actions, and corresponding results are present and clearly linked. All highlight overlays use the correct warm-gold color (#FFD18A), 2px outline, corner brackets, fade/glow timing, and exclusivity, as confirmed by logs and sampled frames. No invented features, calculation misstatements, or technical deviations were found. Audio loudness is within spec and intentional silences are appropriately placed for chapter or transition cues. There are no open issues or mandatory corrections from any batch. 

However, as documented in every review batch, some aspects are not fully assessed by automated or sampled review: the naturalness of the narration, clarity and pronunciation, the absence of background music or noise, and the subjective feel of transition and overlay timing (including motion and hold times). Overlay animation timing (300ms fade-in, 2.4s breath, 200ms fade-out), voice quality, and overall user experience require confirmation in human review. These are appropriately deferred, with no contrary evidence observed.

The film is ready for final human review and CapCut export approval; no advisory or required issues remain open.","issues":[],"resolved_issue_ids":[],"unassessed_checks":["Sampling or logs cannot confirm the naturalness of narration voice, correctness of pronunciation, or overall transition feel; these require human review.","Frame samples do not independently prove overlay 300ms fade-in, 2.4s breathing, or 200ms fade-out—the review relies on highlight log and overlay specifications.","Absence of background music or noise, subjective pleasantness of transitions, and entire motion smoothness require human confirmation."]}
